msgid ""
"Radio “%s”. Lower the throttle to arm the engine. To fly with the keyboard, "
"unplug it."
msgstr "遥控器“%s”。请将油门杆收至最低以解锁。若要使用键盘飞行，请拔下遥控器。"

msgid ""
"Controller “%s”. Lower the throttle to arm the engine. To fly with the "
"keyboard, unplug it."
msgstr "控制器“%s”。请将油门杆收至最低以解锁。若要使用键盘飞行，请拔下控制器。"

