msgid "3D input: about %d × %d (%d%%)."
msgstr "3D 输入：约 %d × %d（%d%%）。"

msgid ""
"FSR2 works in High on compatible AMD, NVIDIA and Intel GPUs. At 1080p, try "
"Native AA or 85% first. Lower scales can lose distant aircraft detail. "
"Compare in motion."
msgstr ""
"FSR2 可在兼容的 AMD、NVIDIA 和 Intel GPU 上以高画质运行。在 1080p 下，建议先试用原生抗锯齿或 85% "
"缩放比例。较低的缩放比例可能会损失远处飞机的细节。请在运动画面中对比。"

msgid ""
"0% disables sharpening. Higher values sharpen edges but can exaggerate halos"
" and shimmer. Only active with FSR2."
msgstr "设为 0% 可关闭锐化。数值越高，边缘越锐利，但可能加重光晕和闪烁。仅在使用 FSR2 时生效。"

msgid ""
"Choose a reconstruction provider supported by this High renderer. Check "
"distant aircraft detail in motion."
msgstr "选择此高画质渲染器支持的重建方式。请在运动画面中检查远处飞机的细节。"

msgid "Restart in High from Home to use reconstruction."
msgstr "从主界面以高画质模式重启后即可使用重建功能。"

msgid ""
"Reconstruction is saved for High. Native rendering is active in Standard."
msgstr "重建设置已保存为高画质模式专用。标准模式当前使用原生渲染。"

msgid ""
"Saved %s is unavailable here. Native rendering is active; the saved choice "
"is preserved."
msgstr "此处无法使用已保存的 %s。当前使用原生渲染，同时保留已保存的选项。"

msgid "FSR2 is unavailable in this engine or renderer."
msgstr "此引擎或渲染器不支持 FSR2。"

msgid ""
"FSR3 requires the native FSR3 extension, its supported runtime and Forward+."
msgstr "FSR3 需要原生 FSR3 扩展、受支持的运行环境以及 Forward+。"

msgid "DLSS requires the NVIDIA Streamline DLSS capability and Forward+."
msgstr "DLSS 需要 NVIDIA Streamline 的 DLSS 功能以及 Forward+。"

msgid "This reconstruction option is unavailable in the current runtime."
msgstr "当前运行环境不支持此重建选项。"

msgid ""
"DLSS manages its own reconstruction sharpness. FSR sharpness is active only "
"with FSR2 or FSR3."
msgstr "DLSS 会自行管理重建锐度。FSR 锐化仅在使用 FSR2 或 FSR3 时生效。"

msgid ""
"0% disables FSR sharpening. Higher values sharpen edges but can exaggerate "
"halos and shimmer. Only active with FSR2 or FSR3."
msgstr "设为 0% 可关闭 FSR 锐化。数值越高，边缘越锐利，但可能加重光晕和闪烁。仅在使用 FSR2 或 FSR3 时生效。"

msgid ""
"Temporal reconstruction provides antialiasing. Your MSAA choice returns with"
" Native rendering."
msgstr "时域重建会提供抗锯齿。切换回原生渲染时，将恢复你的 MSAA 选择。"

msgid ""
"FSR2 works in High on compatible AMD, NVIDIA and Intel GPUs. Quality renders"
" 3D at two-thirds resolution; Native AA keeps full resolution. Check distant"
" aircraft in motion."
msgstr ""
"FSR2 可在兼容的 AMD、NVIDIA 和 Intel GPU 上以高画质运行。质量模式以三分之二分辨率渲染 3D "
"画面；原生抗锯齿则保持全分辨率。请在运动画面中检查远处飞机。"

msgid "Restart in High from Home to use FSR2."
msgstr "从主界面以高画质模式重启后即可使用 FSR2。"

msgid ""
"FSR2 provides antialiasing. Your MSAA choice returns with Native rendering."
msgstr "FSR2 会提供抗锯齿。切换回原生渲染时，将恢复你的 MSAA 选择。"

msgid "FSR2 is saved for High. Native rendering is active in Standard."
msgstr "FSR2 设置已保存为高画质模式专用。标准模式当前使用原生渲染。"

msgid ""
"Choose a reconstruction option available in High graphics. Check distant "
"aircraft detail in motion."
msgstr "选择高画质模式下可用的重建选项。请在运动画面中检查远处飞机的细节。"

msgid ""
"At 1080p, Quality uses about 1280 × 720 3D input; Performance uses 960 × "
"540. Quality keeps more input detail than Balanced or Performance. Lower "
"input may soften distant detail; compare while moving."
msgstr ""
"在 1080p 分辨率下，质量模式使用约 1280 × 720 的 3D 输入分辨率；性能模式使用 960 × "
"540。质量模式保留的输入细节多于均衡或性能模式。较低的输入分辨率可能会模糊远处细节；请在画面运动时进行对比。"

msgid "Reconstruction: Requested %s → Active %s"
msgstr "重建：请求 %s → 当前启用 %s"

msgid "Estimated 3D input: %d × %d → Output: %d × %d"
msgstr "预估 3D 输入：%d × %d → 输出：%d × %d"

msgid ""
"DLSS controls its own reconstruction sharpness. This saved FSR value is kept"
" for FSR2 or FSR3."
msgstr "DLSS 会自行控制重建锐度。此处保存的 FSR 数值会保留，供 FSR2 或 FSR3 使用。"

msgid ""
"FSR sharpness is inactive while Native is active. This saved value stays for"
" FSR2 or FSR3. DLSS controls sharpness when it is active."
msgstr "启用原生渲染时，FSR 锐化不会生效。此数值会保留，供 FSR2 或 FSR3 使用。启用 DLSS 时，锐度由 DLSS 控制。"

msgid ""
"Native rendering does not use FSR sharpness. This saved value is kept for "
"FSR2 or FSR3."
msgstr "原生渲染不使用 FSR 锐化。此数值会保留，供 FSR2 或 FSR3 使用。"

msgid "Native keeps full-resolution 3D input and uses your MSAA choice."
msgstr "原生渲染会保留全分辨率的 3D 输入，并使用你选择的 MSAA 设置。"

msgid ""
"%s keeps full-resolution 3D input and provides antialiasing. Your MSAA "
"choice returns with Native rendering."
msgstr "%s 会保留全分辨率的 3D 输入并提供抗锯齿。切换回原生渲染时，将恢复你的 MSAA 选择。"

msgid ""
"%s renders 3D at about %d × %d while output stays %d × %d. Lower input may "
"soften distant detail; compare while moving."
msgstr ""
"%s 会以约 %d × %d 的分辨率渲染 3D 画面，输出分辨率仍为 %d × %d。较低的输入分辨率可能会模糊远处细节；请在画面运动时进行对比。"

msgid "The current game build does not offer %s reconstruction."
msgstr "当前游戏版本不提供 %s 重建功能。"

msgid "FSR3 support is not included in this game build."
msgstr "当前游戏版本未包含 FSR3 支持。"

