msgstr "逐渐缩小"

msgid "Gentle"
msgstr "轻柔"

msgid ""
"Constant size keeps a distant airplane the same size on screen. Keeps "
"looming lets it shrink slowly, so you still see it come and go. Gentle zooms"
" least. Z turns auto zoom off and on in flight."
msgstr ""
"“保持尺寸”会让远处飞机在屏幕上维持相同大小。“逐渐缩小”会让它慢慢变小，让你仍能看见它逐渐靠近又远离。“轻柔”的变焦幅度最小。飞行时按 Z "
"可开关自动变焦。"

msgid "Keep the horizon in view"
msgstr "保持地平线可见"

msgid "Smooth overhead passes"
msgstr "平滑处理头顶掠过"

msgid "Fly-by"
msgstr "掠过视角"

